<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f5f6f2">
  <title>Interview Arena — KODE CURRENT S2</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="./styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app-shell">
    <header class="topbar">
      <a class="brand" href="#" aria-label="Interview Arena home">
        <span class="brand-mark"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span>
        <span>interview<span class="brand-light">arena</span></span>
      </a>
      <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <button class="nav-link active" data-view="candidateView">Candidate portal</button>
        <button class="nav-link" data-view="recruiterView">Recruiter review <span id="navReviewCount" class="nav-count">0</span></button>
      </nav>
      <div class="topbar-right">
        <span class="secure-label"><span class="tiny-lock">⌑</span> On-device demo</span>
        <span class="user-avatar" aria-hidden="true">DS</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section id="candidateView" class="view active">
        <div class="hero">
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> KODE CURRENT · SEASON TWO · INTERVIEW ARENA</div>
            <h1>Step into the<br><em>Interview Arena.</em></h1>
            <p>A thoughtful, role-aware conversation built for KODE CURRENT Season Two. Share your work, explain your choices, and show how you think.</p>
            <div class="hero-meta">
              <span><b>05</b> main questions</span><i></i><span><b>~18</b> minutes</span><i></i><span><b>01</b> conversation</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="art-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="art-orbit orbit-two"></div>
            <div class="art-card">
              <div class="art-card-top"><span class="mini-dot"></span> INTERVIEW IN PROGRESS</div>
              <div class="waveform"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
              <div class="art-quote">“The most interesting part was<br>what we learned along the way.”</div>
              <div class="art-person"><span class="person-head"></span><span class="person-body"></span><span class="person-spark">✳</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="arena-creature creature-spark" aria-hidden="true"><span class="creature-ear ear-left"></span><span class="creature-ear ear-right"></span><span class="creature-eye eye-left"></span><span class="creature-eye eye-right"></span><span class="creature-cheek cheek-left"></span><span class="creature-cheek cheek-right"></span><span class="creature-mouth"></span></div><div class="arena-creature creature-leaf" aria-hidden="true"><span class="leaf-ear ear-left"></span><span class="leaf-ear ear-right"></span><span class="creature-eye eye-left"></span><span class="creature-eye eye-right"></span><span class="creature-mouth"></span></div><div class="art-note"><span class="note-icon">✦</span><span><b>KODE CURRENT S2</b><small>by Rasient Technohub Pvt. Ltd.</small></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="setupPanel" class="content-grid">
          <section class="card setup-card">
            <div class="card-heading">
              <div><div class="section-kicker">BEFORE YOU BEGIN</div><h2>Set up your interview</h2></div>
              <span class="step-pill">01 <span>/ 02</span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="form-grid">
              <label class="field"><span>Your name</span><input id="candidateName" type="text" maxlength="80" placeholder="e.g. Aisha Patel" autocomplete="name"></label>
              <label class="field"><span>Interview role</span>
                <select id="candidateRole">
                  <option>Frontend Engineer</option><option>Product Manager</option><option>UX Designer</option><option>General</option>
                </select>
              </label>
            </div>
            <label class="field domain-field"><span>Specialty or domain <small>(optional)</small></span><input id="candidateDomain" type="text" maxlength="180" placeholder="e.g. React, fintech, accessibility, mobile apps"></label><div class="permission-box">
              <div class="permission-icon">◉</div>
              <div><b>Camera and microphone are required</b><p>The interview starts only after you grant both permissions. Face counts run in this browser; frames are not stored or uploaded. Optional short review clips save only with separate consent.</p></div>
              <span class="permission-check">Ready to check</span>
            </div>
            <div id="aiModeNotice" class="ai-mode-note" role="status">Scripted practice mode is active. Start the local server with an OpenAI API key for adaptive questions and semantic answer analysis.</div>
            <div class="consent-block">
              <label class="check-row"><input id="consentTerms" type="checkbox"><span class="checkmark"></span><span>I agree to the interview rules: keep only me in camera view, keep camera and microphone on, stay on this tab, and do not paste prepared answers. Rule signals are advisory and may be reviewed by a person.</span></label>
              <label class="check-row"><input id="consentReview" type="checkbox"><span class="checkmark"></span><span>I consent to my transcript and session signals being stored in this browser for review. If OpenAI mode is enabled, my text answers are sent to OpenAI to generate interviewer responses and practice feedback.</span></label>
              <label class="check-row"><input id="consentClips" type="checkbox"><span class="checkmark"></span><span>I consent to short video clips being saved in this browser when a review signal occurs. I can delete them later.</span></label>
            </div>
            <div class="setup-footer">
              <p><span class="privacy-icon">⌑</span> No full-session video recording. Transcript and review signals stay in this browser.</p>
              <button id="startInterview" class="button button-primary">Check setup <span>↗</span></button>
            </div>
            <p id="setupError" class="inline-error" role="alert"></p>
          </section>
          <aside class="card side-card">
            <div class="section-kicker">WHAT TO EXPECT</div>
            <h3>A conversation, not a test.</h3>
            <div class="expect-list">
              <div class="expect-item"><span class="expect-number">01</span><span><b>A welcome, then five tailored questions</b><small>Questions adapt to your role, specialty, and answers.</small></span></div>
              <div class="expect-item"><span class="expect-number">02</span><span><b>Speak or type</b><small>Voice input submits after you pause speaking.</small></span></div>
              <div class="expect-item"><span class="expect-number">03</span><span><b>Human review</b><small>AI notes are practice signals, not a hiring decision.</small></span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="support-note"><span>✦</span><p>Need an accommodation? Contact the organizer before starting so the interview requirements can be adjusted. You can type every answer; browser voice input may use a speech service.</p></div>
          </aside>
        </div>

        <div id="roomPanel" class="content-grid room-grid hidden">
          <section class="card interview-card">
            <div class="room-topline">
              <div><span class="live-dot"></span><span id="roomStatus">SESSION READY</span><span class="subtle-separator">·</span><span id="questionCounter">QUESTION 1 OF 5</span></div>
              <div class="timer"><span>◷</span> <span id="timerText">00:00</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="video-stage">
              <video id="candidateVideo" autoplay muted playsinline></video>
              <div id="videoPlaceholder" class="video-placeholder"><div class="camera-glyph">◉</div><b>Camera preview unavailable</b><span>Camera and microphone access is required before the interview can begin.</span></div>
              <div class="video-label"><span class="video-live"></span> YOUR CAMERA</div>
              <div class="video-caption"><span class="caption-avatar">AI</span><span>Live preview · never uploaded</span></div>
            </div>
            <div id="sessionWarning" class="session-warning hidden" role="alert" aria-live="assertive"><span>⚠</span><span id="sessionWarningText"></span><button id="dismissWarning" type="button" aria-label="Dismiss warning">×</button></div>
            <div class="room-controls">
              <button id="toggleMic" class="control-button" aria-pressed="true"><span class="control-icon">♫</span><span>Mute mic</span></button>
              <button id="toggleCamera" class="control-button" aria-pressed="true"><span class="control-icon">▣</span><span>Turn camera off</span></button>
              <span class="control-spacer"></span>
              <button id="endInterview" class="button button-quiet">End interview</button>
            </div>
            <div class="question-box">
              <div class="question-meta"><span class="ai-avatar">AI</span><span><b>AI interviewer</b><small id="aiModeLabel">Practice interviewer</small></span><span class="speaking-indicator"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span></div>
              <p id="questionText">Tell me about a frontend project you are proud of. What did you own?</p>
              <div class="answer-area">
                <label class="visually-hidden" for="answerInput">Your answer</label>
                <textarea id="answerInput" rows="3" placeholder="Take a moment to think, then share your answer…"></textarea>
                <div class="answer-tools"><button id="speechInput" class="button button-outline"><span>◉</span> <span id="speechButtonText">Use voice input</span></button><span id="speechSupport" class="helper-text">Pausing will submit your spoken answer.</span><button id="skipQuestion" class="button button-quiet" type="button">I’m not sure · skip</button><button id="submitAnswer" class="button button-primary">Submit answer <span>↗</span></button></div>
              </div>
              <div id="answerError" class="inline-error" role="alert"></div>
            </div>
          </section>
          <aside class="card signals-card">
            <div class="signals-heading"><div><div class="section-kicker">SESSION CHECKS</div><h3>Review signals</h3></div><span id="signalCount" class="count-badge">0</span></div>
            <p class="signal-disclaimer">Signals are imperfect context for human review. They do not determine misconduct.</p>
            <div class="check-status-list">
              <div class="status-row"><span id="cameraStatusDot" class="status-dot neutral"></span><span><b>Camera</b><small id="cameraStatusText">Waiting for access</small></span><span class="status-value" id="cameraStatusValue">—</span></div>
              <div class="status-row"><span id="micStatusDot" class="status-dot neutral"></span><span><b>Microphone</b><small id="micStatusText">Waiting for access</small></span><span class="status-value" id="micStatusValue">—</span></div>
              <div class="status-row"><span id="tabStatusDot" class="status-dot good"></span><span><b>Interview tab</b><small>Visibility changes are logged</small></span><span class="status-value">ON</span></div>
              <div class="status-row"><span id="faceStatusDot" class="status-dot neutral"></span><span><b>Face count</b><small id="faceStatusText">Starts after camera access</small></span><span class="status-value" id="faceStatusValue">—</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="audio-meter-block"><div><b>Ambient audio level</b><span id="audioLevelLabel">Not connected</span></div><div class="meter-track"><span id="audioMeter"></span></div><small>Level spikes are logged as context. They can include your own voice or background noise.</small></div>
            <div class="signal-log-heading"><b>Signal timeline</b><span>NEWEST FIRST</span></div>
            <div id="signalList" class="signal-list"><div class="empty-signals">No review signals yet.<br><span>We’ll show any session context here.</span></div></div>
            <div class="signal-footer"><span class="privacy-icon">⌑</span> Clips only save with your consent.</div>
          </aside>
        </div>

        <section id="completePanel" class="card complete-card hidden">
          <div class="complete-icon">✓</div><div class="section-kicker">INTERVIEW COMPLETE</div><h2>Thanks for sharing your work, <span id="completeName">there</span>.</h2>
          <p id="completeSummary">Your practice feedback is ready. A recruiter can review the transcript and session context.</p>
          <div id="candidateScorecard" class="candidate-scorecard"></div>
          <div class="complete-actions"><button id="toRecruiter" class="button button-primary">Open recruiter review <span>↗</span></button><button id="startAnother" class="button button-outline">Start another interview</button></div>
        </section>
      </section>

      <section id="recruiterView" class="view">
        <div class="dashboard-header">
          <div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> RECRUITER WORKSPACE</div><h1>Review with<br><em>context.</em></h1><p>Interview notes, transcripts, and session signals in one place. Every scorecard is a starting point for human review.</p></div>
          <div class="dashboard-actions"><button id="loadDemo" class="button button-outline">＋ Load demo candidate</button><button id="clearData" class="button button-quiet">Clear local data</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-grid">
          <div class="metric-card"><span class="metric-label">INTERVIEWS</span><b id="metricInterviews">0</b><small>Saved in this browser</small><span class="metric-symbol">◌</span></div>
          <div class="metric-card"><span class="metric-label">COMPLETED</span><b id="metricCompleted">0</b><small>Ready for review</small><span class="metric-symbol">✓</span></div>
          <div class="metric-card"><span class="metric-label">REVIEW SIGNALS</span><b id="metricSignals">0</b><small>Context only · not verdicts</small><span class="metric-symbol">⌁</span></div>
          <div class="metric-card"><span class="metric-label">AVERAGE PRACTICE SCORE</span><b id="metricScore">—</b><small>Not a hiring recommendation</small><span class="metric-symbol">↗</span></div>
        </div>
        <section class="card table-card">
          <div class="table-heading"><div><div class="section-kicker">CANDIDATE SESSIONS</div><h2>Recent interviews</h2></div><button id="refreshDashboard" class="button button-outline small-button">↻ Refresh</button></div>
          <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>CANDIDATE</th><th>ROLE</th><th>DATE</th><th>STATUS</th><th>SIGNALS</th><th>SCORE</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="sessionRows"></tbody></table></div>
          <div id="emptyDashboard" class="empty-dashboard hidden"><span class="empty-illustration">◌</span><b>No interviews saved yet</b><p>Complete a candidate interview or load the clearly labeled demo profile to explore recruiter review.</p><button id="emptyLoadDemo" class="button button-outline">Load demo candidate</button></div>
        </section>
        <div class="dashboard-footnote"><span class="privacy-icon">⌑</span><span>Demo data, transcripts, signals, and clips are stored locally in this browser. No hiring decision should be made from automated scores or signals.</span></div>
        <section id="reviewDetail" class="card review-detail hidden">
          <div class="detail-heading"><div><div class="section-kicker">CANDIDATE REVIEW</div><h2 id="detailName">Candidate</h2><p id="detailMeta"></p></div><button id="closeDetail" class="button button-quiet">Close ×</button></div>
          <div id="detailScorecard" class="detail-scorecard"></div>
          <div class="detail-columns">
            <div><h3>Interview transcript</h3><div id="detailTranscript" class="transcript-list"></div></div>
            <div><h3>Session signals <span class="review-only-label">HUMAN REVIEW</span></h3><div id="detailSignals" class="detail-signals"></div></div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer class="site-footer"><span>INTERVIEW ARENA <span>·</span> KODE CURRENT S2</span><span>Designed for candidate clarity and human-led review</span></footer>
  </div>
  <div id="toast" class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <script src="./app.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>

